#: c6f012e249674b9ca9968b96bb67e1ce ec83811a8d7945568d9fb1f1f912afe8
msgid ""
"This utility provides an easy to use viewer for ArduPilot dataflash and "
"telemetry logs. Data can be plotted and even manipulated, and the flight "
"visually re-flown in 3D. It is accessed `HERE <http://plot.ardupilot.org>`__"
" and is web based, although most of the computations are done locally in the"
" web browser. Both Chrome/Chromium and FireFox are supported browsers."
msgstr ""
"该工具为 ArduPilot dataflash 和数传日志提供易于使用的查看器。数据可绘制甚至进行处理，飞行过程可在 3D 中可视化回放。通过 `此处"
" <http://plot.ardupilot.org>`__ 访问，基于网络使用，尽管大部分计算在本地浏览器中完成。支持 "
"Chrome/Chromium 和 FireFox 浏览器。"

