#: 974799cbfae748d58f805590a47c3ea5 fe8eb2e155a64329915bf9d11243981e
msgid ""
"Upon accessing, this panel is presented. You can \"Open (a) Sample\" file to"
" experiment with, or load an ArduPilot .tlog or .bin  log file, either by "
"drag and drop or by clicking to obtain a file explorer dialog to select the "
"file."
msgstr ""
"访问后，将显示此面板。您可以「Open (a) Sample」打开示例文件进行实验，或通过拖放或点击文件浏览器对话框来加载 ArduPilot 的 "
".tlog 或 .bin 日志文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:19
#: 06ae863c1c8e4001906bcfb6b7ca981a 13ddb3d691f94e7187a683f682a06030
#: 4fdfdab38c004e47b9a35f6a7ef40b5b 7418b813a9f044ec865911a25c59ce50
