#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:26
#: 2403d60539924b65a2359b09333fd88f 28157671274e46a6bcb649f927441e41
#: 30d8a62138c541ebacb1129b0d3c8b12 7476fb2932f24f34876c97d692d29afe
#: ad3536d7843a4dadace67965b4cb6e04 b80b7296b7044c0a804efba901f0a2bb
#: c5170066c17a42e8b75564503b32517a d7d6fbb1472b4cff83e09bb28a43673d
msgid ""
"which is the 3D flight viewer. You can replay the flight in 3D by pressing "
"the \"play\" button, or \"pause\", \"reverse\", or  change playback "
"\"speed\". Various map tools/options are in the upper right corner."
msgstr ""
"这是 3D 飞行查看器。您可以点击「play」按钮回放 3D "
"飞行，或「pause」、「reverse」、或更改回放「speed」。右上角提供各种地图工具/选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:28
#: 26fccc141596443fa83a1f48d4f330ec 8507384c3003445888a286cac2522475
#: 8b4285ae62b9402da9cabfea85e7e571 959038437f7c488d886a8ea107404240
#: d2306414ff2a4e9095e3689093ed3b2e d690af70d6bd486e8fd6bf8bd12a8865
#: dcbdef2f59314d3e84c64b581d777840 e617721d360845a293568bfac01e877e
msgid ""
"In the upper left are setup menu buttons for the Plot (whose options are "
"shown already), 3D panel, and additional widgets for parameters, log "
"messages, and a joystick visualizer for the first four RC channels."
msgstr "左上角是 Plot（已显示选项）、3D 面板以及参数、日志消息和前四个 RC 通道摇杆可视化组件的设置菜单按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:31
#: 1fb4e88ffd934164965b4adfec5b1418 21e1fe5ceafd4e9e84234c5ee69007f6
#: 66bbd10c9118447b96faeb761ef864cf 9a445aadcdf44eef991d54d29eae6ad6
#: a735fdabaf8a45c3a04981ff2ca1fc56 b509c26b98cb49f3b0c3c8e4c642c7af
#: bffb905e030d48d6b9d2996517130b16 c5caf85f25f645a48506033954a381a2
msgid "3D View Options"
msgstr "3D 视图选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:37
#: 0dc6b01a39124b748f823c6b67f15e74 1e24bdaac797412886d50a1bb44d2a73
#: 2846bb0886ae47fa95d519e15bf5c8ba 618f71c32a3048b580529ce5b31db878
#: 692a471de9d34577bcdeb2e740d70cbf 6b9e51d56e8a4e83b4f1a4f30bbbe249
#: cd2def747acd4ee3b8b91d85fdcc759a f699538c7ab444438dd8a0b375669e85
msgid ""
"In this panel, you can change the camera mode in 3D playback, if waypoints "
"and/or trajectory is shown, the size of the vehicle in the display, and the "
"data source used for showing the trajectory."
msgstr "在此面板中，您可以更改 3D 回放中的相机模式、是否显示航点和/或轨迹、飞行器在画面中的大小，以及用于显示轨迹的数据源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:40
#: 0f8d59d043004cc68ca675e72c763b90 1a86d68e4c2149008dc14bf0778e2442
#: 25b756f270ac471691aa591a656a3be7 62fce2170c704599b9badef5b6f592af
#: 7e3c6aba8c1a407a8c1e440bf6b0f291 9c1e41ecdab94b0f8e3ff96edd21ab81
#: b048fdf624c3478eb527db26ed4c968c ca80d4b99f2f4057b5aa559b06cbfb9d
msgid "Plot Options"
msgstr "绘图选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:45
#: 2cf9e294e6f34a6caf27d887e4d8390d 2f46984f884144288804acc5eb3eca13
#: 7cde417a75d64bf08eba6f37bcd37e78 7f5bee9fe4a04283a34602b7a1ae1233
#: 8503384a622e4abeb6396229e5693110 8f26379af59d49ed83d22c8d0cf1bac0
#: 9f73e816b2e04a58a9c3b8e7237e60e3 ced3a827d3b94b28837e14299a63aacc
msgid ""
"This is one of the most powerful features of the viewer. This allows you to "
"select which log values are plotted. You can search for an individual field "
"to  plot, eg for CTUN.NavRoll you would type \"Nav\") or just navigate thru "
"to the message with that field. Here we have plotted CTUN.NavRoll, "
"CTUN.Roll,CTUN.NavPitch, and CTUN.Pitch.The Navigation controller's desired "
"roll and pitch versu actual. ( For a complete list of log messages, see: "
"`Copter Log Messages <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/logmessages.html>`__"
" , `Plane Log Messages "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/logmessages.html>`__ , or `Rover Log "
"Messages <https://ardupilot.org/rover/docs/logmessages.html>`__ )."
msgstr ""
"这是查看器最强大的功能之一。它允许您选择要绘制的日志值。您可以搜索单个字段进行绘制，例如 CTUN.NavRoll "
"可输入「Nav」，或直接浏览到包含该字段的消息。此处绘制了 CTUN.NavRoll、CTUN.Roll、CTUN.NavPitch 和 "
"CTUN.Pitch，即导航控制器的期望横滚和俯仰与实际值的对比。（完整日志消息列表参见：`Copter Log Messages "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/logmessages.html>`__、`Plane Log Messages "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/logmessages.html>`__ 或 `Rover Log Messages"
" <https://ardupilot.org/rover/docs/logmessages.html>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:48
#: 04d2e30b811c4f82b59e5dd3fa0e82a4 0937915a026f4669abee5d2ed8846713
#: 51e70463e7704b10a6152f7416af9b97 7304ffaef43549898f7ca108da7fc858
#: a8a502267e1841918df7c3362d934f51 b891762054c54bdc897b35e3d97eae04
#: c5f3abf2da004be8a27d63991965aade d6b624e8b1a44090ad5bee311450280b
msgid "Presets"
msgstr "预设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:50
#: 066fd725f7ec49b2a840ffa40bc59086 0effba555bcd47ebb2015a3d15d7d464
#: 1520ed12075d4cecb45ceb68254418c4 84e610ab138a47ef83ae8c9cf808c266
#: 985d43cc3b8c46f7b2b9a535f6ba4cca 9d3ecbed2a0c40028b2ce01d8f56911e
#: 9d5b5341a4ea4f74a3e3ab195c0f590c e8c85f402f20492ea65462919b960997
msgid ""
"Above the \"Plot Individual Field\" dropdown, is a \"Presets\" dropdown with"
" many commonly used combinations of data plots already pre-configured."
msgstr "在「Plot Individual Field」下拉菜单上方，有一个「Presets」下拉菜单，其中预配置了许多常用数据绘图组合。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:53
#: 41f4fc37328d4ec8adad7bfe4c085cce 696e83d8c83f43ee8e8740e95afe68e6
#: 70b8b4dc2c2c499fafc4dcf362d95340 be5810e8f64545a3b4de5740b62effd8
#: cbf608be6dce49818b6bf0534799b3ab d1da5985db77455b8106defbe0b05dd2
#: e660db00d3a74be7b5271e12f5333ac0 f427519f99eb4b479bd3813d9e91f22a
msgid "Plot Features"
msgstr "绘图功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:55
#: 4297242fbe314b60ab9a54f7aa4daa46 584887a926a744fe966c6c64f3012c87
#: 7dd3c1e7d3c446c29f3bd2dca701165e 8aaed2b96f914cac997012aa536532ad
#: c4040701c5de4076a939abcc7b57712d c5febd5f4fd64cbe9b1475ff08927971
#: d3b6339d0978490992a713442ecae0b1 d9b037287d8a47218b90f3c17b05be0f
msgid ""
"When each field is added, a Y axis number is assigned, and the data "
"autoscaled and centered. This can be changed by hovering over the axis and "
"scrolling to change scale, or clicking and moving the origin. If you wish to"
" automatically align and scale several fields to one another, just set the y"
" axis number to be the same. They will remain together from that point on."
msgstr ""
"添加每个字段时，将分配一个 Y "
"轴编号，并自动缩放和居中。您可以将鼠标悬停在轴上并滚动以更改比例，或点击并移动原点。如果希望将多个字段自动对齐并缩放到同一比例，只需将 Y "
"轴编号设为相同值，之后它们将保持联动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:57
#: 100f1a935da544ca980291d6b5070895 34e17ee2e1b343c9b4e913bf241f4a83
#: 525bffee573a418681ac9c88cb18e72a 6552632c78674bcdb8e6929377fd73d5
#: ae42acfd68a747e98f03f4ed508727d8 dbf98b606ab6471abc4e5997128957d1
#: f30946345baa4497a4b7f7617a6f7af8 fdc54686815643908c091bbf8f1383a5
msgid "You can change the color code by clicking the color swatch."
msgstr "可点击颜色色块更改颜色代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:59
#: 2b9aa7693916499e87d7662f48fb6ebd 52830567b8014acebfdaacd995793115
#: 767e6e310af64aec855768e3fdeb9f6a 79536a28d6694bc4a5a789c3aed39bf3
#: 8feb0de2cdbe46d8a777870dc5790b55 b11bc7d51b4944679c8f048aabfae3ae
#: d14cff94fabe4b56b2134c671a3f9deb e47110c4af17461daeba70d304a689e3
msgid "You can remove a data plot by clicking the trash can icon."
msgstr "可点击垃圾桶图标删除数据绘图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:61
#: 60e8fdf380dd4aaf821ec2c8876ea715
msgid ""
"You can even create and plot expressions that use the fields by \"Add "
"Expression\" button. See ` Graph Expressions for MavExplorer "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-"
"analysis.html#graph-expressions>`__ for examples of using expressions in a "
"plot analysis."
msgstr ""
"您甚至可以通过「Add Expression」按钮创建并绘制使用字段的表达式。有关在绘图分析中使用表达式的示例，请参见 ` Graph "
"Expressions for MavExplorer <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/using-"
"mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.html#graph-expressions>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:63
#: 45d123190eb04fcfb73f688c8248258a 6085f55dd1604ddc989d51a3720ba7cc
#: 8361edc4e96644279ff6f5e3a7f609b5 9dbaabc4334147b08157dc71f7984c97
#: ab2e61e2b21e439eb96b4a8bdd02eb8b b63b70b4b6514610b77cb90e4c0adc55
#: ccbc700f794446b381ac46b01cda689f d4d7402d326840a7882551babbadfc72
msgid ""
"You can also save the present plot and its setup using the \"Save Preset\" "
"button. These are persistent from session to session. A preset can be "
"removed by tbd."
msgstr "您还可以使用「Save Preset」按钮保存当前绘图及其设置，这些设置在会话之间持久存在。预设可通过待定方式删除。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:65
#: 4041683bd5e6492f955be32e749f68ed 552d1174d5694a4c8164620a5b5d21ca
#: 5fb0e6e6985a48f78526b1a794c939fa 6c4b9b1ed41947d6ac9f822d6f09ef8d
#: 80b62b378c4b467084092a7168524397 b2e35461d1ee401baa9191eb11375ba0
#: d78c0ec50ebb480484c71b710832211f ec2965caafe14188b0fb05e0f764950e
msgid ""
"Using the slider bars on the timeline under the main graphs, you can narrow "
"or expand the plot region of the lob and move its center on the log "
"timeline. Note that the 3D graph follows."
msgstr "使用主图表下方时间轴上的滑块，可以缩小或扩大日志的绘图区域，并在日志时间轴上移动其中心。注意 3D 图形会随之联动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:67
#: 19bdea4edbfe4a3cb0b4ca5e76fa073b 265782f5d8cd423fba29ae2f5c33abba
#: 2ed86c6d6aab4b469739b469f6d91ccd 3ecf7bdb3218418087aa84dd4d0f3189
#: 40ccb0bd59064f0facfbae66385da82a c39da07b3b034565b09c232eaaa40bfe
#: cff050985ac643e6a0622f0c75881e0f fc56c3bfc372485ea1e8f99d59f99bef
msgid ""
"The mouse cursor will move the 3D plot's time position. It can also show the"
" exact values of each plot line at its current position."
msgstr "鼠标光标将移动 3D 图的时间位置，并可显示每条绘图线在当前位置的精确值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:69
#: 07b49c6bd522448989b376dc95699662 19500a9e5ed54cab9221664215fbd0bf
#: 1fc1f1bf9626405bb305727acbd8e173 30b0ccf18654419cad100864731d0956
#: 663bb5d74e8847bface39327e6303533 c1a46e5a74b34326b621056f41219d53
#: c28e82af7f024048932f08a989106219 f1180aeeee3142c4affaf393194626e5
msgid ""
"You can dismiss the 3D screen by clicking in the X box in its upper right "
"corner. The entire right side will now be devoted to the plots."
msgstr "可点击 3D 界面右上角的 X 框关闭 3D 界面，整个右侧区域将完全用于绘图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:76
#: 16b11fbd611d4b569d2a148494d888b5 56fa0b14b049407c909f592f8f0f343c
#: 907e5dc1ecea4f588ec14cad3ad01ac6 b546dc65c28a4e11a1f481ea68b4baf6
#: c47ed33f70a042fb8d6ff467eed9ea0b d207d9cfb60d4ad19bd20107eb92f6ce
#: fb88992df2c14e07bd3eaeed1d325090 fc02e5af881b4774b1594ca967e53343
msgid ""
"If you move the mouse to the upper right corner of the plot screen, several "
"options will become visible. You can take a snapshot of the plot area, re-"
"auto scale, zoom, move, change what values appear with the mouse cursor, "
"toggle x/y lines that move with cursor position, etc."
msgstr ""
"将鼠标移至绘图界面右上角，将显示多个选项：可拍摄绘图区域快照、重新自动缩放、缩放、移动、更改鼠标光标显示的值、切换随光标位置移动的 x/y 线等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:79
#: 248bcbd2b3dc4a678608fa849419ed9e 2b824b48ae444247bafe719b8933c467
#: 61def8f6e0a748eb9b04c1e62d46d8ec 62debbb46fc845d390d44f8218d2fc72
#: 80c7f8f315b94d81b5a4dc525acd0722 8e8b41058f17409ebe7ec904e396aa64
#: a036e40a4f4c4fa18479a271ed07eba4 d596ed6cf60a4a8fa56e405027ebf341
msgid "Widgets"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:81
#: 18969d6b80ab45818fe21cc0e7c01336 1cdedd481a044e909ebee9e195c21cfa
#: 4a8696667878424ab7a46af2d7aa8196 75fa8ccce5d445cbabe195b8fe2a2b44
#: a626dddd731d4f2285d49416d17c1911 acfc19acd4fb463492c4a6028c322632
#: c5ee041b5bf94676bac1999c22c7ced3 d67abe32c71e4684a5bd81c93f192b19
msgid ""
"Three widgets are available when you click the widgets menu at the top left "
"of the screen."
msgstr "点击屏幕左上角的组件菜单，可使用三个组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavlogviewer.rst:87
#: 043ee72fe0404a9f8f90a32b93863bc0 16dfe9b2b22b4cd99ec78e0fe00c966a
#: 2e14b169e17f4b7badc28a86a9cb74ef 492b42a93f3b4725a68e1b9444b4e6b6
#: 852979a171a04deda7161f1a80095f6b 967f6073416342f4967960aec003aa38
#: bda6afbdd1ac41c3800d1b23e665c4e9 cf3fdc56b42a484086ec92f017e4354e
msgid ""
"These are sizable (bottom right corners) and movable (upper left corner) "
"panels that display the log messages up to the cursor point, the joystick "
"positions (first 4 rc channels), and a searchable parameter list. These can "
"be shown or dismissed with their buttons when in this setup menu. Click "
"\"Plot\" or \"3D\" to return to those screens."
msgstr ""
"这些面板可调整大小（右下角）和移动（左上角），显示光标点之前的日志消息、摇杆位置（前 4 个 RC "
"通道）以及可搜索的参数列表。在此设置菜单中可使用其按钮显示或关闭这些面板。点击「Plot」或「3D」可返回相应界面。"

